  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 0.5.0 continues the ContentSystem-backed rebuild introduced in 0.2.0. It redesigns command values around logical IDs, resolved value maps, bulk defaults, and one optional trailing positional argument, while preserving explicit-source views and binding-specific rules. It also includes command permissions, runtime availability checks, and access-aware autocomplete. ContentSystem remains outside the public API. This is not a drop-in upgrade from the legacy 0.1.0 package.",
